    <description>CleanGeek recovers real disk space from the places Windows quietly fills up: browser and
application caches, temporary files, crash dumps, delivery optimisation files and Windows Update
leftovers.

* See what each category will free before anything is deleted
* Clean per-category rather than all-or-nothing
* Windows Update leftovers and old servicing files, which are usually the biggest win
* Deliberately has NO registry cleaner - they do not free meaningful space and they do break things
* No account, no adverts, no bundled offers

Open source under GPL-3.0. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install first.</description>
    <summary>Free disk cleaner for Windows that recovers real space, with no registry cleaner</summary>
